OL,3,AJay-Z to perform at Super Bowl
OL,4,Ahalf-time show
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Jay-Z will perform at the Super
OL,7,FBowl half-time show in February, the
OL,8,FNFL has announced.
OL,10,FJay-Z's company Roc Nation has produced
OL,11,Fthe half-time show since 2019, and he
OL,12,Fplays a key role in selecting each
OL,13,Fyear's performer but he has not
OL,14,Fperformed before at the NFL
OL,15,Fchampionship game.
OL,17,F"Anticipation as to who Jay-Z might
OL,18,Fhave guest star at halftime for the big
OL,19,Fgame will now kick off," the NFL said
OL,20,Fin a statement. "Of course, his wife,
OL,21,FBeyonce, will be atop the list."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
